Network Design: 
Access Control: Our company's access controls will mainly be role-based. 
Authentication: For authentication we will apply password policies like MFA, SSO, accountlock out, password uniqueness, secure password storage, and much more.  
Monitoring & Logging: We will monitor systems that have to deal with user authentication, password policies, and access control. We will detect anomalies by implementing an autoscan system that would scan all files and other things alike to see if there are any issues that are detected.
Patch Management: We will keep our systems updated by implementing an automatic Ai tool that updates our software after a few days and while the AI is updating the software it will also try to discover any glitches or bugs in the system.
